---
description: SDD workflow rules for AI-assisted feature development
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use the root `AGENTS.md` as the routing entrypoint.

For any `sdd-*` command or code-changing request, read:

- `docs/sdd/AGENTS.md`
- `docs/sdd/workflow.md`
- `docs/sdd/commands/AGENTS.md`
- `docs/sdd/commands/{command}.md`

Do not modify production or test code unless the current feature has:

- Confirmed `spec.md`
- Reviewed `plan.md`
- Approved `tasks.md`

